     <property name="text">
      <string>&lt;p&gt;This is a starting point for a desktop application: a window with a sidebar, a few pages, and the patterns most applications need.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Form&lt;/b&gt;: input, validation and a confirmation before discarding.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Table&lt;/b&gt;: a model shown in a view, with sorting, filtering and deleting.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Task&lt;/b&gt;: long work on a second thread, with progress and cancel.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Settings&lt;/b&gt;: a light and a dark theme, remembered between runs.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;Replace these pages with your own.&lt;/p&gt;</string>
     </property>
